  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Do you want to know something very funny ? I stole this pendant from her
      one night when she dozed off ! Ever since then, she has not even been able
      to remember her own daughter\u2019s face !"
  - speaker: 0
    text: How could you do that to yourself ? And why ?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh you know, I was feeling bored and I found it funny. It was so shiny
      that I couldn't help myself !
